      "content": "GREAT MISSENDEN        POTTER ROW SP 90 SW 2/93                                                 (west side)                                                      Large Barn at Bury Farm GV                                                      II C18 timber-framed, brick and weatherborded walls.  Old tile roof.  Two gabled cart entrances, lean-to on yard side.  Seven bays, jowled posts with curved braces to tie beams which carry curved principals supporting two sets of purlins. Listing NGR: SP9066602091"
